{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eaab0145-5c24-8ac4-9aa5-85015586360b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-25T12:51:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, good afternoon. I am calling the storm line because I know it is Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I hope this is the right number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, we're answering the storm line today. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow came down my street this morning and it knocked over my mailbox. The whole post, it is lying in the snow now, flat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Which street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dixon Street. Number 470. That is in the North End, not far from the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 470 Dixon Street. And the plow hit the mailbox and the post came down. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The box is still attached, but the post is broken at the bottom. I did not see the plow. I only saw it after, when I went out to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And this was this morning, with the snow coming in before it turns to rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this morning. The snow is turning now, it is getting wet. So I am calling after the worst part, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds right. Let me put that in the report. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Erin Kearney. K-E-A-R-N-E-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Erin. And a number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So, my question is, when will it be cleared? The mailbox, I mean. The snow is also piled around it. And the mail carrier needs to reach it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Crews are focused on the roads right now, so the mailbox will be looked at after the storm wraps up. I'd expect somebody to follow up in the next few days, probably sooner than later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. I can set it upright myself for now, with the snow. Maybe that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, go ahead. If you can, take a photo of it first and keep it with the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will do that. Sorry, one small thing. I have been humming the same tune all morning, and I cannot stop. It is very annoying. Anyway, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens to all of us. You're all set, Erin. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
